==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|hostelerie}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|hostelries}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} An [[inn]] that provides [[overnight]] [[accommodation]] for [[traveller]]s (and, originally, their [[horse]]s).
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The art and skill of guest management at a commercial facility such as a [[hotel]], inn, [[motel]], [[bed and breakfast]], or [[hostel]].
#: ''the '''hostelry''' trade''
#: ''a degree in '''hostelry''' and tourism''

